'''Ronald Arden Essink''' (born July 30, 1958) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was an [[offensive tackle]] for the [[Seattle Seahawks]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Grand Valley State Lakers football|Grand Valley State Lakers]].
